/** Source paragraph, including trailing blank lines. */
val test =
  let part1 = nofibStringToList("In the constructive programming community it is commonplace to see ")
  let part2 = nofibStringToList("formal developments of textbook algorithms. In the algorithm design ")
  let part3 = nofibStringToList("community, on the other hand, it may be well known that the textbook ")
  let part4 = nofibStringToList("solution to a problem is not the most efficient possible. However, in ")
  let part5 = nofibStringToList("presenting the more efficient solution, the algorithm designer will ")
  let part6 = nofibStringToList("usually omit some of the implementation details, this creating an ")
  let part7 = nofibStringToList("algorithm gap between the abstract algorithm and its concrete ")
  let part8 = nofibStringToList("implementation. This is in contrast to the formal development, which ")
  let part9 = nofibStringToList("usually presents the complete concrete implementation of the less ")
  let part10 = nofibStringToList("efficient solution.\n\n")
  let lastParts = LCons(part8, LCons(part9, LCons(part10, LNil())))
  let middleParts = LCons(part5, LCons(part6, LCons(part7, lastParts)))
  concat(LCons(part1, LCons(part2, LCons(part3, LCons(part4, middleParts)))))
//│ CTML translation succeeded.

